WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Search. Bound the geographic question and the maximum returned sample.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Normalize. Put different providers' metadata into a common set of columns.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Learn. Preserve unknown cloud values as missingness information before clustering.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Inspect. Map valid footprints and compare groups with provider counts and cloud metadata.
